      <p><seg source="#source-460-495">ダツク　ドツク　ダクン</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-495-524">チエン　ダン　デン</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-524-541">ピー　……</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-541-558">フー　……</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-558-577">ボドー……</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-577-605">弁当箱がぬくもる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-605-625">工場の正午は</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-625-652">鉄の尖端で光が眠る</seg></p>
    </body>
